WEBVTT

00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:10.850
Storm's coming, and you boys...

00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:13.250
You are smack in the middle of it.

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:22.950
You know the truth about
Sammy and the other children.

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:25.450
Andrew Gallagher. Ava Wilson.

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:26.950
I didn't hurt anybody. Not yet.

00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:30.150
Max, your abilities started
seven months ago, right?

00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:30.950
How'd you know that?

00:00:30.950 --> 00:00:32.450
The same thing killed our mothers.

00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:36.550
You and I were chosen.

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:37.650
For what? I don't know.

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:44.750
I saw this guy die
days before it happened.

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:46.550
You can make people
do things, can't you?

00:00:46.550 --> 00:00:47.550
You can tell them what to think.

00:00:48.050 --> 00:00:50.450
Cherry ride. Can I have it? Sure, man.

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:55.350
You must be one of us.

00:00:56.150 --> 00:00:56.850
Who? The psychics.

00:00:56.850 --> 00:00:59.650
Screw you, buddy, 'cause
i'm a secretary from peoria,

00:00:59.650 --> 00:01:00.450
And i'm not part of anything.

00:01:00.850 --> 00:01:02.850
This demon tells me they have soldiers

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:04.250
To fight in this coming war

00:01:04.550 --> 00:01:06.250
Psychics fighting on hell's side.

00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:10.150
The yellow-Eyed man tells me
to do things -- Awful things.

00:01:10.150 --> 00:01:11.950
He told me he's got big plans.

00:01:12.350 --> 00:01:14.750
Maybe this is his plan. Maybe
we're all supposed to be --

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:16.150
What, killers? Give me a break.

00:01:16.150 --> 00:01:17.550
No one's heard anything about Ava.

00:01:17.550 --> 00:01:19.450
She's just -- Into
thin air, you know?

00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:24.450
Sulfur. Ava.

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:25.450
Demon's been here.

00:01:25.450 --> 00:01:27.550
If something bad's
coming, it's coming fast,

00:01:27.550 --> 00:01:29.050
And their side holds all the cards.

00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:32.050
We can't run from this,
and you can't protect me.

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:34.850
Damn it, Sam, this whole thing
is spinning out of control.

00:01:52.950 --> 00:01:54.750
Hey, don't forget the
extra onions this time, huh?

00:01:55.550 --> 00:01:58.550
Dude, i'm the one who's
gonna have to ride in the car

00:01:58.550 --> 00:01:59.650
With your extra onions.

00:02:02.850 --> 00:02:03.950
Hey, see if they got any pie.

00:02:06.150 --> 00:02:07.050
Bring me some pie!

00:02:10.050 --> 00:02:11.050
Bring me some pie.

00:02:56.450 --> 00:02:57.250
Sam?

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:39.450
Sulfur

00:03:41.850 --> 00:03:42.850
Sam!

00:03:43.050 --> 00:03:43.850
Sammy!

00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:47.250
Sam!

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:51.150
Sammy!

00:03:57.650 --> 00:03:59.450
Sam!

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:02.450
Andy? Sam.

00:06:02.950 --> 00:06:04.150
What are you doing here? I don't know.

00:06:04.150 --> 00:06:05.650
What am I doing here? I don't know.

00:06:05.850 --> 00:06:07.250
Where are we?

00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:08.550
Andy, look, calm down.

00:06:09.450 --> 00:06:10.150
I can't calm down.

00:06:10.150 --> 00:06:13.450
I just woke up in
freaking frontier land.

00:06:13.450 --> 00:06:14.650
What's the last thing you remember?

00:06:16.850 --> 00:06:20.250
Honestly, my fourth bong load.

00:06:21.850 --> 00:06:22.750
It was weird.

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:24.550
All of a sudden,

00:06:25.350 --> 00:06:28.250
There was this really
intense smell, like a...

00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:29.950
Like sulfur?

00:06:30.850 --> 00:06:31.550
How did you know that?

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:33.850
Dean.

00:06:33.850 --> 00:06:35.150
Your brother -- Is
he -- Is he here?

00:06:36.150 --> 00:06:37.250
I don't know where he is.

00:06:39.150 --> 00:06:40.050
I don't know if he's...

00:06:46.850 --> 00:06:47.750
Hello?

00:06:48.650 --> 00:06:50.950
Woman: no! Help me!

00:06:51.750 --> 00:06:53.150
Okay, okay, i'm here.

00:06:53.150 --> 00:06:54.150
We're gonna get you out, all right?

00:06:54.550 --> 00:06:55.550
Just hold on a second.

00:07:03.450 --> 00:07:04.450
All right, one second.

00:07:07.550 --> 00:07:10.750
Ava? Oh, my god! Sam!

00:07:10.750 --> 00:07:11.650
Hey.

00:07:13.650 --> 00:07:14.450
So, I guess you guys know each other.

00:07:15.650 --> 00:07:16.550
Yeah.

00:07:16.550 --> 00:07:18.650
How did you -- I
mean, how did --

00:07:18.650 --> 00:07:19.850
Ava, have you been here this whole time?

00:07:20.150 --> 00:07:23.150
What whole time? I just woke
up in there a half an hour ago.

00:07:23.150 --> 00:07:24.650
Well, you've been gone for five months.

00:07:24.650 --> 00:07:26.450
My brother and I have been
looking for you everywhere.

00:07:27.350 --> 00:07:29.450
That's impossible 'cause
I saw you two days ago.

00:07:29.450 --> 00:07:30.850
You didn't. I'm sorry.

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:36.150
But that makes no sense. It's...not...

00:07:36.150 --> 00:07:39.950
Oh, my god! My fianc? Brady.

00:07:39.950 --> 00:07:42.850
If I've been missing for that
long, he must be freaking out!

00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:45.650
Well...

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:46.550
Oh!

00:07:48.450 --> 00:07:49.250
Hey.

00:07:50.850 --> 00:07:52.850
Andy -- Also
freaking out.

00:07:53.850 --> 00:07:54.850
Okay.

00:07:55.250 --> 00:07:56.350
What's happening?

00:07:57.850 --> 00:07:58.750
Well, I, uh...

00:07:59.150 --> 00:08:01.150
I don't really know yet,
but I know one thing.

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:03.250
I know what the three
of us have in common.

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:05.550
Man: hello? Anybody there?

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:07.350
Maybe more than three.

00:08:08.450 --> 00:08:09.250
Wait.

00:08:12.650 --> 00:08:13.450
Hello?

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:14.650
Hey!

00:08:16.150 --> 00:08:17.050
Hey, you guys all right?

00:08:17.950 --> 00:08:18.850
Think so.

00:08:19.050 --> 00:08:19.950
I'm Sam.

00:08:20.450 --> 00:08:22.050
I'm Jake. Lily.

00:08:22.550 --> 00:08:23.350
Are there any more of you?

00:08:23.650 --> 00:08:24.550
No.

00:08:24.550 --> 00:08:25.550
How did we even get here?

00:08:25.550 --> 00:08:27.150
A minute ago, I was in san diego.

00:08:27.450 --> 00:08:28.850
Well, if it makes you feel any better,

00:08:29.350 --> 00:08:31.550
I went to sleep last
night in Afghanistan.

00:08:33.050 --> 00:08:35.150
Let me take a wild guess.
You two are both 23?

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:39.350
We all are, and we all have abilities.

00:08:39.850 --> 00:08:40.450
What?

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:42.150
It started a little over a year ago.

00:08:42.350 --> 00:08:44.950
You find you can do things
you didn't think were possible.

00:08:47.650 --> 00:08:50.150
I have visions. I see
things before they happen.

00:08:50.150 --> 00:08:51.250
Yeah, me too.

00:08:51.250 --> 00:08:54.550
And I can put thoughts into people's
heads -- Like, make them do stuff.

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:56.950
Oh, but don't worry. I don't
think it works on you guys.

00:08:57.350 --> 00:08:59.550
Oh, but get this -- Um,
I've been practicing,

00:08:59.750 --> 00:09:01.950
Training my brain,
like meditation, right?

00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:04.250
So now it's not just
thoughts that I can beam out,

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:06.550
But images, too --
Like, anything I want.

00:09:06.550 --> 00:09:08.350
It's like bam! People, they see it.

00:09:08.650 --> 00:09:11.950
This one guy I know -- Total
dick -- I used it on him.

00:09:13.350 --> 00:09:15.950
Gay porn all hours of the day.

00:09:16.850 --> 00:09:17.850
It's just like...

00:09:17.850 --> 00:09:19.750
You should have seen
the look on his face.

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:33.350
You go, "simon says give me
your wallet," and they do?

00:09:33.850 --> 00:09:36.050
You have visions? That's great.

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:37.650
I'd kill for something like that.

00:09:37.650 --> 00:09:39.350
Lily, listen, it's okay.

00:09:39.350 --> 00:09:40.350
No, it's not.

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:43.750
I touch people. Their hearts stop.

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:46.150
I can barely leave my house.

00:09:46.550 --> 00:09:48.050
My life's not exactly improved.

00:09:49.050 --> 00:09:51.750
So screw you. I just want to go home.

00:09:51.750 --> 00:09:52.850
And we don't?

00:09:52.850 --> 00:09:54.450
Don't -- Hey,
gs, come on.

00:09:54.450 --> 00:09:56.750
Look, whether we like it
or not, we're all here,

00:09:56.750 --> 00:09:58.650
And so we all have to deal with this.

00:09:59.050 --> 00:10:00.450
Who brought us h here?

00:10:02.750 --> 00:10:05.250
It's less of a "who."
It's more of a "what."

00:10:05.650 --> 00:10:06.750
What does that mean?

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:10.050
It's, uh...

00:10:13.150 --> 00:10:13.950
It's a demon.

00:10:18.850 --> 00:10:22.550
This is it -- All demonic signs
and omens over the past month.

00:10:23.050 --> 00:10:24.050
Are you joking? There's nothing here.

00:10:24.550 --> 00:10:25.250
Exactly.

00:10:26.250 --> 00:10:27.450
Come on, there's got to be something.

00:10:27.450 --> 00:10:29.250
What about the normal,
low-Level stuff --

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:30.550
You know, exorcisms, that kind of thing?

00:10:30.850 --> 00:10:33.750
There's nothing. It's completely quiet.

00:10:34.050 --> 00:10:36.950
How are we supposed to look for
Sam, close our eyes and point?

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:42.850
Sam: Ash, what do you got?

00:10:42.850 --> 00:10:45.850
Okay, listen. It's a
bit negatory on Sam.

00:10:46.150 --> 00:10:47.750
Come on, man. You got
to give us something.

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:49.650
We're looking at a
3,000-Mile haystack here.

00:10:50.050 --> 00:10:53.450
Listen, Dean. I did find something.

00:10:54.050 --> 00:10:54.750
Well, what?

00:10:55.950 --> 00:10:57.450
I can't talk over this line, Dean.

00:10:57.750 --> 00:10:58.950
Come on, I don't have time for this.

00:10:59.050 --> 00:11:01.050
Make time, ok, cause this..

00:11:02.250 --> 00:11:04.450
What's up? What's going on?

00:11:05.250 --> 00:11:05.950
Not only does this

00:11:05.950 --> 00:11:08.650
Almost definitely help you
find your brother, this is...

00:11:10.750 --> 00:11:11.550
It's huge.

00:11:11.950 --> 00:11:13.350
So get here now.

00:11:18.450 --> 00:11:19.550
I guess we're going to the roadhouse.

00:11:20.150 --> 00:11:20.950
Come on.

00:11:27.650 --> 00:11:30.850
So, we're soldiers in a demon
war to bring on the apocalypse?

00:11:30.850 --> 00:11:31.650
When you put
it like that --

00:11:31.650 --> 00:11:34.150
And we've been picked? Why us?

00:11:34.150 --> 00:11:36.250
I'm not sure, okay?
But look, I just know --

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:38.250
Sam. I'm sorry.

00:11:38.250 --> 00:11:40.850
Psychics and spoon-Bending
is one thing, but demons?

00:11:40.850 --> 00:11:43.250
It sounds crazy. It
doesn't just sound it.

00:11:43.250 --> 00:11:44.450
I don't care what you think.

00:11:44.450 --> 00:11:47.750
If we're gathered here together,
that means it's starting.

00:11:47.750 --> 00:11:50.350
The only thing I got to do is
stay away from wackjobs, okay?

00:11:50.950 --> 00:11:53.350
I've heard enough. I'm
better off on my own.

00:11:53.350 --> 00:11:55.050
Fyi -- So
are you.

00:11:57.550 --> 00:11:58.550
Jake, hold on.

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:01.150
Jake!

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:35.850
Hello?

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:40.850
It's all right. Don't be scared.

00:12:43.450 --> 00:12:44.250
Are you lost?

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:48.150
Hello?

00:13:09.050 --> 00:13:09.950
Get back!

00:13:19.450 --> 00:13:20.150
Just so you know...

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:22.750
That was a demon.

00:13:29.150 --> 00:13:30.150
And that thing?

00:13:30.450 --> 00:13:32.350
I'm not sure, but I
think it was an achiri --

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:35.050
A demon that disguises
itself as a little girl.

00:13:35.650 --> 00:13:36.850
Still doesn't tell us where we are.

00:13:38.450 --> 00:13:39.350
Andy, you with me or what?

00:13:40.050 --> 00:13:40.850
Give me a minute.

00:13:40.850 --> 00:13:43.850
I'm still working
through "demons are real."

00:13:49.650 --> 00:13:50.550
I've seen that bell before.

00:13:52.650 --> 00:13:53.650
I think I know
where we are now --

00:13:54.650 --> 00:13:55.950
Cold oak, south dakota.

00:13:56.450 --> 00:13:59.050
The town's so haunted,
every single resident fled.

00:13:59.550 --> 00:14:03.350
Swell. Good to know we're
somewhere so historical.

00:14:03.750 --> 00:14:06.450
Why in the world would that
demon or whatever put us here?

00:14:07.250 --> 00:14:08.050
I'm wondering the same thing.

00:14:10.750 --> 00:14:12.150
You know what? It doesn't matter.

00:14:12.650 --> 00:14:15.350
The only sane thing to do here
is get the hell out of dodge.

00:14:15.350 --> 00:14:15.850
Wait, hold on.

00:14:15.850 --> 00:14:17.950
Lily, the only way out
is through miles of woods.

00:14:18.350 --> 00:14:20.050
Beats hanging out with demons.

00:14:20.050 --> 00:14:22.150
Lily, we don't know what's going on yet.

00:14:22.150 --> 00:14:24.550
We don't even know how
many of them are out there.

00:14:24.550 --> 00:14:25.950
Yeah, he's right.
We should --

00:14:25.950 --> 00:14:28.750
Don't say "we." I'm not part of "we."

00:14:28.750 --> 00:14:30.550
I have nothing in
common with any of you.

00:14:30.750 --> 00:14:31.850
Okay, look.
I know --

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:32.950
You don't know anything.

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:35.850
I
to--

00:14:37.050 --> 00:14:39.250
I accidentally touched my girlfriend.

00:14:45.250 --> 00:14:46.050
I'm sorry.

00:14:47.350 --> 00:14:48.250
Whatever.

00:14:49.250 --> 00:14:50.850
I feel like i'm in a nightmare,

00:14:50.850 --> 00:14:53.050
And it just keeps
getting worse and worse.

00:14:56.650 --> 00:14:57.750
I've lost people, too.

00:15:00.650 --> 00:15:01.950
I have a brother out there right now.

00:15:04.050 --> 00:15:05.350
He could be dead, for all I know.

00:15:08.150 --> 00:15:10.450
We're all in bad shape,
but i'm telling you,

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:13.050
The best way out of this
is to stick together.

00:15:15.950 --> 00:15:16.650
Fine.

00:15:20.750 --> 00:15:23.950
We're looking for iron, silver,
salt -- Any kind of weapon.

00:15:24.350 --> 00:15:25.350
Salt is a weapon?

00:15:25.350 --> 00:15:26.450
It's a brave, new world.

00:15:27.150 --> 00:15:28.950
Hopefully, there's food in your world,

00:15:28.950 --> 00:15:30.150
'Cause i'm freaking starving.

00:16:04.750 --> 00:16:05.650
What the hell?

00:16:33.050 --> 00:16:34.050
My god.

00:16:36.150 --> 00:16:36.850
You see Ellen?

00:16:44.050 --> 00:16:44.650
No.

00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:46.950
No Ash, either.

00:16:56.650 --> 00:16:57.950
Oh, Ash, damn it!

00:17:53.650 --> 00:17:54.650
Hey, you all right?

00:17:55.450 --> 00:17:56.250
Yeah, i'm just...

00:17:57.550 --> 00:17:58.550
I don't know --
A little dizzy.

00:17:59.850 --> 00:18:01.250
A-Are you sure it's
not some kind --

00:18:01.250 --> 00:18:02.950
What, some kind of freaky vision thing?

00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:06.450
No, more like I'd just
kill for a sandwich.

00:18:07.150 --> 00:18:08.550
I haven't eaten since...

00:18:10.150 --> 00:18:11.050
Well, who knows.

00:18:12.450 --> 00:18:13.150
No,
it's --

00:18:13.150 --> 00:18:14.450
Don't worry, i'm fine,

00:18:14.950 --> 00:18:17.350
Except for every single
thing that's happening.

00:18:19.350 --> 00:18:21.350
You guys, I found something!

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:29.650
Salt.

00:18:29.650 --> 00:18:32.350
That's great, Andy.
Now we all can s--

00:18:34.450 --> 00:18:35.250
Where's Lily?

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:39.150
Lily?

00:18:40.450 --> 00:18:41.350
Lily!

00:18:54.250 --> 00:18:55.150
Oh, my god!

00:19:02.750 --> 00:19:06.450
Okay, that -- That's
officially just...

00:19:06.450 --> 00:19:08.550
Sam, she's dead! She's dead!

00:19:08.550 --> 00:19:10.450
You said we were chosen for a reason.

00:19:10.450 --> 00:19:14.150
That is not chosen. That's...killed.

00:19:14.150 --> 00:19:15.850
Okay, you know, we
have to get out of here.

00:19:15.850 --> 00:19:18.250
I second that emotion.
Not sure that's an option.

00:19:18.850 --> 00:19:20.150
Lily was trying to leave.

00:19:20.150 --> 00:19:22.050
The demon's not gonna
let us get away that easy.

00:19:22.750 --> 00:19:24.250
We got to gear up for the next attack.

00:19:24.250 --> 00:19:25.650
Oh, gear up? Yeah.

00:19:26.750 --> 00:19:29.450
Okay, well, i'm not a
soldier. I can't do that!

00:19:29.450 --> 00:19:31.350
Look, if you want to stay
alive, you're gonna have to.

00:19:37.250 --> 00:19:38.450
Let's go.

00:19:38.450 --> 00:19:39.450
Oh, okay.

00:19:40.650 --> 00:19:41.450
I'll get her down.

00:19:46.150 --> 00:19:46.950
You know...

00:19:47.150 --> 00:19:48.950
I was just thinking about how
much Dean would help right now.

00:19:49.950 --> 00:19:51.450
I'd give my arm for a working phone.

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:54.050
You know, you may not need one.

00:19:54.350 --> 00:19:56.850
I, uh, I mean, I've never
tried it long-Distance before.

00:19:56.850 --> 00:19:58.750
Do you have anything of Dean's on you,

00:19:58.750 --> 00:19:59.750
Like something he touched?

00:20:00.350 --> 00:20:01.050
Uh...

00:20:02.950 --> 00:20:04.950
I got a receipt. Will that work?

00:20:04.950 --> 00:20:05.750
Yeah.

00:20:08.950 --> 00:20:10.250
D. Hasselhoff?

00:20:10.250 --> 00:20:11.950
Yeah, that's Dean's signature.

00:20:13.150 --> 00:20:14.150
It...

00:20:14.950 --> 00:20:15.750
It's hard to explain.

00:20:16.950 --> 00:20:17.850
All right.

00:20:21.250 --> 00:20:21.950
This is...

00:20:22.550 --> 00:20:23.750
What the hell did Ash know?

00:20:24.950 --> 00:20:27.850
We got no way of knowing where
Ellen is or if she's even alive.

00:20:28.450 --> 00:20:29.850
We got no clue what
Ash was gonna tell us.

00:20:29.850 --> 00:20:31.150
Now, how the hell are we gonna find Sam?

00:20:32.150 --> 00:20:32.950
We'll find him.

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:36.050
Dean? No!

00:20:36.950 --> 00:20:37.750
Unh!

00:20:41.150 --> 00:20:43.050
Unh!

00:20:45.950 --> 00:20:46.650
What was that?

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:51.550
I don't know. Headache?

00:20:52.250 --> 00:20:53.650
You get headaches like that a lot?

00:20:55.050 --> 00:20:55.950
No.

00:20:58.950 --> 00:20:59.950
It must be the stress.

00:21:03.250 --> 00:21:05.350
I could have swore I saw something.

00:21:05.350 --> 00:21:07.650
What do you mean?
Like -- Like a vision?

00:21:07.650 --> 00:21:10.050
Like what Sam gets? What? No.

00:21:10.050 --> 00:21:11.150
I'm just saying.

00:21:11.150 --> 00:21:12.250
Come on, i'm not some psychic.

00:21:15.450 --> 00:21:17.350
Unh! Oh, god! Dean?!

00:21:21.650 --> 00:21:22.450
Dean?

00:21:24.150 --> 00:21:24.950
Are you with me?

00:21:27.150 --> 00:21:28.050
Yeah, I think so.

00:21:28.950 --> 00:21:31.750
I saw Sam. I saw him, Bobby.

00:21:32.250 --> 00:21:33.250
It was a vision.

00:21:33.550 --> 00:21:34.250
Yeah.

00:21:34.950 --> 00:21:37.350
I don't know how,
but -- But yeah.

00:21:37.950 --> 00:21:38.750
Whew!

00:21:39.750 --> 00:21:41.650
That was about as fun as
getting kicked in the jewels.

00:21:41.750 --> 00:21:42.750
What else did you see?

00:21:43.350 --> 00:21:46.250
Uh, there was a bell.

00:21:46.550 --> 00:21:47.250
What kind of bell?

00:21:49.150 --> 00:21:50.750
Um, like,
a big --

00:21:50.750 --> 00:21:54.250
A big bell with some
kind of engraving on it.

00:21:54.250 --> 00:21:54.850
I don't know.

00:21:54.850 --> 00:21:55.650
Engraving?

00:21:55.650 --> 00:21:56.750
Yeah.

00:21:56.750 --> 00:21:58.850
Was it a tree --
Like, an oak tree?

00:22:00.550 --> 00:22:01.550
Yeah, exactly.

00:22:03.150 --> 00:22:04.550
I know where Sam is.

00:22:23.250 --> 00:22:25.350
I-I'm not superman or anything.

00:22:25.350 --> 00:22:26.350
It's no big deal.

00:22:26.650 --> 00:22:28.450
You were in afghanistan
when this started?

00:22:28.650 --> 00:22:30.050
I started getting headaches,

00:22:31.150 --> 00:22:34.050
Then, uh, there was this accident.

00:22:34.350 --> 00:22:36.250
This guy flipped his
vehicle on a bad road,

00:22:36.650 --> 00:22:38.650
Got pinned underneath.

00:22:39.250 --> 00:22:40.850
I lifted it off him like it was nothing.

00:22:41.450 --> 00:22:45.050
E-Everybody said it was
a fluke adrenaline thing.

00:22:45.050 --> 00:22:46.350
But then you did it again, right?

00:22:46.350 --> 00:22:49.250
Bench-Press 800
pounds, stone-Cold calm.

00:22:50.850 --> 00:22:52.150
I never told anybody, of course.

00:22:52.150 --> 00:22:53.550
It's just too crazy.

00:22:54.150 --> 00:22:56.850
Yeah, well, crazy's relative.

00:22:57.650 --> 00:22:58.750
I'm starting to get that.

00:23:00.050 --> 00:23:00.850
Yeah.

00:23:02.750 --> 00:23:05.250
By the way, I, uh,
appreciate what you're doing.

00:23:06.450 --> 00:23:07.250
What am I doing?

00:23:07.950 --> 00:23:10.350
Keeping calm, keeping them calm,

00:23:10.450 --> 00:23:12.750
Especially considering how
freaked to hell you really are.

00:23:16.350 --> 00:23:18.250
I've been in some deep
crap before myself.

00:23:18.250 --> 00:23:19.250
I know the look.

00:23:26.750 --> 00:23:27.550
Want to know the truth?

00:23:28.550 --> 00:23:29.850
I got this brother, right?

00:23:30.650 --> 00:23:32.950
And he's always telling me how
he's gonna watch out for me,

00:23:32.950 --> 00:23:35.450
How everything's gonna be okay,
like I've been telling them.

00:23:35.950 --> 00:23:36.750
Yeah.

00:23:38.050 --> 00:23:39.450
I don't know if I believe it this time.

00:23:41.550 --> 00:23:42.750
I mean, the size
of what's coming --

00:23:44.950 --> 00:23:46.250
It's bigger than anyone's ever seen.

00:23:47.250 --> 00:23:50.350
I mean, it's gonna get bad,
and I-I don't know if --

00:23:50.350 --> 00:23:51.450
If we're gonna make it.

00:23:52.650 --> 00:23:54.350
It doesn't matter if we believe it.

00:23:55.250 --> 00:23:56.550
Only matters that they do.

00:24:27.750 --> 00:24:29.850
My horoscope said I shouldn't
have gotten out of bed.

00:24:34.650 --> 00:24:35.350
How you doing?

00:24:36.050 --> 00:24:36.950
Holding up?

00:24:36.950 --> 00:24:37.750
I'm okay.

00:24:39.250 --> 00:24:40.250
What about you?

00:24:40.550 --> 00:24:41.750
Not so okay.

00:24:44.050 --> 00:24:45.250
Why us, Sam?

00:24:46.450 --> 00:24:48.350
What did we do to deserve this?

00:24:48.850 --> 00:24:50.050
Just lucky, I guess.

00:24:50.550 --> 00:24:53.350
If it wasn't for bad luck,
wouldn't have no luck at all.

00:24:56.050 --> 00:24:57.450
Just can't wait for this all to be over

00:24:57.450 --> 00:25:00.050
So I can just pretend it never happened.

00:25:02.050 --> 00:25:04.950
Just want to curl up with
Brady and watch bad tv.

00:25:08.950 --> 00:25:09.850
What is it?

00:25:12.450 --> 00:25:14.250
Sam, do you

00:25:16.550 --> 00:25:17.850
Know something that I don't?

00:25:19.950 --> 00:25:20.650
Look, Ava.

00:25:24.350 --> 00:25:26.450
I'm sorry. I wish I didn't
have to tell you this

00:25:26.450 --> 00:25:26.750
Tell me what?

00:25:29.350 --> 00:25:32.250
When the demon broke in
to your house to take you,

00:25:34.950 --> 00:25:36.050
Your fianc?Didn't make it

00:25:37.650 --> 00:25:38.550
I'm sorry.

00:25:41.350 --> 00:25:43.250
No, it's...

00:26:20.150 --> 00:26:21.250
Jake, behind you!

00:26:21.650 --> 00:26:22.450
Howdy, Sam.

00:26:27.050 --> 00:26:27.850
I'm dreaming.

00:26:28.750 --> 00:26:32.350
What do you say you and
I take a little walk?

00:26:42.350 --> 00:26:45.750
You're awfully quiet, Sam.
You're not mad at me, are you?

00:26:47.250 --> 00:26:49.450
I'm gonna tear you to shreds, I swear.

00:26:49.950 --> 00:26:52.850
When you wake up, tiger,
you give it your best shot.

00:26:53.850 --> 00:26:54.750
Where's my brother?

00:26:54.750 --> 00:26:58.350
Quit worrying about Dean.
I'd worry more about yourself.

00:26:58.350 --> 00:26:59.850
What, you gonna kill me?

00:27:02.350 --> 00:27:04.450
I'm trying to help you.
That's why we're talking.

00:27:04.450 --> 00:27:06.050
You're the one i'm rooting for.

00:27:08.950 --> 00:27:10.050
What's that supposed to mean?

00:27:10.550 --> 00:27:13.150
Welcome to the miss america pageant.

00:27:13.150 --> 00:27:15.050
Why do you think you're here?

00:27:15.050 --> 00:27:16.550
This is a competition.

00:27:16.550 --> 00:27:20.750
Only one of you crazy kids is

00:27:20.750 --> 00:27:22.550
Gonna make it out of here alive.

00:27:22.550 --> 00:27:23.450
I thought we were
supposed to be --

00:27:23.450 --> 00:27:24.950
Soldiers in a coming war?

00:27:24.950 --> 00:27:28.450
That's true. You are.
But here's the thing.

00:27:30.850 --> 00:27:32.050
I don't need soldiers.

00:27:34.550 --> 00:27:38.450
I need soldier. I just need the one.

00:27:39.450 --> 00:27:39.950
Why?

00:27:39.950 --> 00:27:42.250
I couldn't just come out
and say that, could I, Sam?

00:27:42.250 --> 00:27:44.850
I had to let everyone think
they had a fighting chance.

00:27:44.850 --> 00:27:46.050
But what I need...

00:27:47.350 --> 00:27:48.350
Is a leader.

00:27:49.050 --> 00:27:50.150
To lead who?

00:27:52.450 --> 00:27:57.650
Oh, I've already got my army
-- Or I will soon, anyway.

00:27:58.050 --> 00:27:59.250
You son of a bitch.

00:27:59.250 --> 00:28:02.950
Honestly, i'm surprised
you hadn't guessed.

00:28:02.950 --> 00:28:06.050
I mean, why do you think so many
children flamed out already --

00:28:06.050 --> 00:28:09.250
Max Miller and Andy's
brother -- What's his name?

00:28:09.650 --> 00:28:12.350
They weren't strong enough.

00:28:12.950 --> 00:28:18.950
I'm looking for the best and
brightest of your generation.

00:28:20.250 --> 00:28:21.350
My generation?

00:28:21.650 --> 00:28:23.950
Well, there's other generations,

00:28:23.950 --> 00:28:25.550
But let's just worry about yours.

00:28:25.950 --> 00:28:27.450
That's why i'm here, Sam.

00:28:27.450 --> 00:28:29.650
I want to give you the inside track.

00:28:30.250 --> 00:28:33.650
You're tough, you're
smart, you're well-Trained,

00:28:34.150 --> 00:28:35.150
Thanks to your daddy.

00:28:35.750 --> 00:28:36.650
Sam.

00:28:39.050 --> 00:28:39.950
Sammy...

00:28:41.350 --> 00:28:42.450
You're my favorite.

00:28:43.050 --> 00:28:47.650
You ruined my life. You
killed everyone I love.

00:28:48.150 --> 00:28:50.350
The cost of doing business, i'm afraid.

00:28:51.450 --> 00:28:54.550
I mean, sweet, little jessica...

00:28:55.250 --> 00:28:56.650
She just had to die.

00:28:57.250 --> 00:29:00.750
You were all set to marry
that little, blond thing,

00:29:01.050 --> 00:29:03.750
Become a tax lawyer with
two kids, a beer gut,

00:29:03.750 --> 00:29:05.450
And a little mcmansion in the suburbs.

00:29:05.450 --> 00:29:07.750
I needed you sharp, on the road,

00:29:07.750 --> 00:29:11.550
Honing your skills
-- Your gifts.

00:29:11.950 --> 00:29:12.950
What about my mom?

00:29:13.950 --> 00:29:14.850
That was bad luck.

00:29:15.250 --> 00:29:15.950
Bad luck.

00:29:15.950 --> 00:29:19.050
She walked
in on us --

00:29:19.550 --> 00:29:20.850
Wrong place, wrong time.

00:29:21.450 --> 00:29:22.150
What does that mean?

00:29:22.150 --> 00:29:25.150
It wasn't about her. It was about you.

00:29:26.050 --> 00:29:27.550
It's always been about you.

00:29:29.050 --> 00:29:30.050
What?

00:29:34.850 --> 00:29:35.750
Well...

00:29:37.350 --> 00:29:41.350
Okay, you caught me
in a charitable mood.

00:29:42.050 --> 00:29:42.950
I'll show you.

00:29:45.250 --> 00:29:46.950
Look familiar? It should.

00:29:51.550 --> 00:29:54.650
Relax, Sam. This is just
a high-Def instant replay.

00:29:55.350 --> 00:29:56.350
Enjoy the show.

00:29:57.150 --> 00:29:58.050
John.

00:29:58.350 --> 00:29:58.850
Mom.

00:29:58.850 --> 00:29:59.850
Is he hungry?

00:30:02.050 --> 00:30:02.950
Shh.

00:30:04.350 --> 00:30:05.250
Okay.

00:30:05.250 --> 00:30:06.250
Wait, mom.

00:30:06.650 --> 00:30:07.950
Mom!

00:30:07.950 --> 00:30:09.850
What did I just tell you,
Sam? She can't hear you.

00:30:10.450 --> 00:30:11.550
This isn't real.

00:30:17.050 --> 00:30:18.050
What the hell are you doing to me?

00:30:18.350 --> 00:30:19.550
Better than mother's milk.

00:30:24.450 --> 00:30:26.250
Does this mean I have...

00:30:26.950 --> 00:30:27.850
Demon blood in me?

00:30:30.150 --> 00:30:31.250
Answer me!

00:30:34.550 --> 00:30:35.250
It's you.

00:30:35.550 --> 00:30:36.450
She knew you.

00:30:40.450 --> 00:30:41.250
No.

00:30:46.450 --> 00:30:47.550
No!

00:30:49.650 --> 00:30:51.250
I don't think you want
to see the rest of this.

00:30:52.550 --> 00:30:53.550
Sam, wake up.

00:30:55.550 --> 00:30:56.550
Ava's missing.

00:31:10.950 --> 00:31:12.250
I'll take the barn and the hotel.

00:31:12.850 --> 00:31:14.050
You take the houses. All right.

00:31:14.450 --> 00:31:15.550
Meet back here in 10 minutes, okay?

00:31:47.350 --> 00:31:49.350
Ava, where'd you go?

00:31:50.850 --> 00:31:52.250
Didn't you hear us yelling?

00:31:52.250 --> 00:31:53.150
Yeah, I heard you.

00:32:06.250 --> 00:32:07.050
What are you doing?

00:32:12.950 --> 00:32:13.750
Holy...

00:32:14.450 --> 00:32:16.950
Ah! Aah!

00:32:17.650 --> 00:32:18.450
Aah!

00:32:41.050 --> 00:32:43.850
Sam, I just found him like this!

00:32:44.250 --> 00:32:45.150
What happened?

00:32:45.550 --> 00:32:46.250
I don't know.

00:32:46.950 --> 00:32:47.950
How did that thing get in?

00:32:54.350 --> 00:32:55.150
Where were you?

00:32:55.450 --> 00:32:57.850
I just went to get some
water from the well.

00:32:57.850 --> 00:33:00.250
I was only gone, maybe,
like, two minutes.

00:33:02.450 --> 00:33:03.750
You shouldn't have gone outside.

00:33:04.450 --> 00:33:05.550
Ava, we have to stay in here.

00:33:09.350 --> 00:33:10.250
Who did that?

00:33:11.150 --> 00:33:12.350
I don't know.
Maybe Andy --

00:33:12.350 --> 00:33:13.450
Andy wouldn't do that.

00:33:15.350 --> 00:33:16.950
Ava, that line wasn't
broken when I left.

00:33:20.250 --> 00:33:20.950
Ava.

00:33:20.950 --> 00:33:21.950
What? You
don't think --

00:33:21.950 --> 00:33:24.050
I'll tell you what I think. Five months.

00:33:24.550 --> 00:33:26.850
You're the only one with all
that time you can't account for.

00:33:27.650 --> 00:33:28.750
And that headache you got...

00:33:30.650 --> 00:33:31.850
Right when the demon got Lily.

00:33:31.850 --> 00:33:33.250
What are you trying to say?

00:33:33.250 --> 00:33:34.150
What happened to you?

00:33:34.150 --> 00:33:35.150
Nothing!

00:33:46.350 --> 00:33:47.750
Had you going, though, didn't I?

00:33:50.750 --> 00:33:51.750
Yeah.

00:33:53.250 --> 00:33:56.650
I've been here a long
time, and not alone, either.

00:33:56.650 --> 00:34:01.150
People just keep showing
up -- Children, like us.

00:34:04.250 --> 00:34:06.150
Batches of three or four at a time.

00:34:06.150 --> 00:34:08.350
You killed them
-- All of them?

00:34:10.350 --> 00:34:12.250
I'm the undefeated heavyweight champ.

00:34:12.450 --> 00:34:13.550
Oh, my god.

00:34:13.850 --> 00:34:15.950
I don't think god has
much to do with this, Sam.

00:34:17.150 --> 00:34:18.050
How could you?

00:34:19.750 --> 00:34:21.350
I had no choice.

00:34:22.050 --> 00:34:23.150
It's me or them.

00:34:23.150 --> 00:34:25.550
After a while, it was easy.

00:34:26.050 --> 00:34:27.250
It was even kind of fun.

00:34:29.150 --> 00:34:30.250
I just stopped fighting it.

00:34:30.550 --> 00:34:31.350
Fighting what?

00:34:31.650 --> 00:34:33.150
Who we are, Sam.

00:34:34.050 --> 00:34:35.750
If you'd just quit your hand-Wringing

00:34:35.750 --> 00:34:36.950
And open yourself up,

00:34:36.950 --> 00:34:39.050
You have no idea what you can do.

00:34:39.050 --> 00:34:41.250
The learning curve is so fast.

00:34:41.250 --> 00:34:44.650
It's crazy, the switches
that just flip in your brain.

00:34:45.450 --> 00:34:49.150
I can't believe I started
out just having dreams.

00:34:51.650 --> 00:34:52.950
Do you know what I can do now?

00:34:53.750 --> 00:34:54.650
Control demons.

00:34:55.350 --> 00:34:57.750
Ah. You are quick on the draw.

00:35:03.750 --> 00:35:05.350
Yeah, i'm sorry, Sam, but...

00:35:06.650 --> 00:35:07.650
It's over.

00:35:37.150 --> 00:35:38.950
It looks like the rest
of the way's on foot.

00:35:45.850 --> 00:35:46.650
Let's go.

00:35:51.650 --> 00:35:52.750
I think we can make it out of here now.

00:35:53.350 --> 00:35:53.950
But the achiri demon.

00:35:53.950 --> 00:35:55.850
No, no, no, Ava was
summoning it, controlling it.

00:35:55.850 --> 00:35:57.150
It shouldn't come back
now that she's dead.

00:35:57.750 --> 00:35:58.650
We got to go.

00:35:59.750 --> 00:36:00.450
No. Not "we," Sam.

00:36:02.250 --> 00:36:04.250
Only one of us is getting
out of here. I'm sorry.

00:36:04.650 --> 00:36:06.050
What? I had a vision.

00:36:06.050 --> 00:36:07.850
That yellow-Eyed demon,
or whatever it was,

00:36:07.850 --> 00:36:08.750
He talked to me.

00:36:08.750 --> 00:36:09.850
He told me how it was.

00:36:09.850 --> 00:36:11.450
No, Jake, listen. You
can't listen to him.

00:36:11.450 --> 00:36:13.750
Sam, he's not letting us go.

00:36:13.750 --> 00:36:14.650
Only one.

00:36:14.950 --> 00:36:16.750
Now, we don't play
along, he'll kill us both.

00:36:17.550 --> 00:36:20.250
Now, I-I like you, man. I
do, but do the math, here.

00:36:20.250 --> 00:36:22.150
What good's it do for both of us to die?

00:36:22.650 --> 00:36:24.150
Now, I can get out of here,

00:36:24.150 --> 00:36:26.350
I get close to the demon,
I can kill the bastard.

00:36:26.350 --> 00:36:27.750
Come with me. We can kill him together.

00:36:27.750 --> 00:36:29.150
How do I know you won't turn on me?

00:36:29.850 --> 00:36:30.750
I won't.

00:36:30.750 --> 00:36:31.750
I don't know that.

00:36:34.950 --> 00:36:35.750
Okay, look.

00:36:49.450 --> 00:36:50.450
Just come with me, Jake.

00:36:51.850 --> 00:36:52.850
Don't do this.

00:36:53.450 --> 00:36:54.650
Don't play into what it wants.

00:37:09.950 --> 00:37:11.050
Okay.

00:37:13.850 --> 00:37:14.650
Ugh!

00:38:36.550 --> 00:38:37.550
Sam!

00:38:47.450 --> 00:38:48.250
Sam!

00:38:48.550 --> 00:38:49.450
Dean.

00:38:51.650 --> 00:38:52.750
Sam, look out!

00:38:55.150 --> 00:38:55.950
No!

00:39:06.950 --> 00:39:07.650
No. Sam.

00:39:08.350 --> 00:39:10.250
Whoa, Sam. Sam.

00:39:10.250 --> 00:39:11.050
Sam, hey.

00:39:13.250 --> 00:39:14.350
Hey, come here.

00:39:14.350 --> 00:39:14.950
Let me look at you.

00:39:19.150 --> 00:39:21.250
Hey, look. Look at me.
It's not even that bad.

00:39:21.750 --> 00:39:22.850
It's not even that bad, all right?

00:39:24.350 --> 00:39:25.150
Sammy?

00:39:25.550 --> 00:39:26.250
Sam!

00:39:26.250 --> 00:39:28.550
Hey, listen to me. We're
gonna patch you up, okay?

00:39:29.450 --> 00:39:30.250
You'll be good as new.

00:39:31.150 --> 00:39:32.050
Huh?

00:39:32.250 --> 00:39:33.150
I'm gonna take care of you.

00:39:33.150 --> 00:39:35.350
I got you. That's my job, right?

00:39:35.350 --> 00:39:37.950
Watch out for my
pain-In-The-Ass little brother.

00:39:39.250 --> 00:39:40.150
Sam?

00:39:40.850 --> 00:39:41.750
Sam.

00:39:41.750 --> 00:39:42.650
Sam!

00:39:43.450 --> 00:39:44.350
Sammy!

00:39:49.050 --> 00:39:50.750
No. No, no, no.

00:39:51.850 --> 00:39:52.650
Oh, god.

00:39:56.050 --> 00:39:57.050
Oh, god.

00:40:14.650 --> 00:40:15.750
Sam!

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:10.650
